        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/cc4b7fb74d981b19349d4808476e5b8b2b12f75a/models/2026-delphi10000-cavia-porcellus-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L163-L249> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cavia-porcellus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
